[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3150938634","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109215#issuecomment-3150938634","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109215","id":3150938634,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67z4IK","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-04T14:23:16Z","updated_at":"2025-08-04T14:23:16Z","body":"> I haven't tested but this makes sense to have accurate (orthonormal) Basis.\r\n> \r\n> I hope it's not too performance heavy because that'll require a more complicated system.\r\n\r\nI put together a test scene that should be basically worst case and ran it with a profiler on it for a while. That line ended up being 0.617% of total time while `update_transform` was 11.3%, so it's about a 5.8% slowdown. That's actually a bit higher than I expected, but still doesn't seem unreasonable.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3150938634/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3152094696","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109215#issuecomment-3152094696","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109215","id":3152094696,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc674SXo","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-04T19:35:05Z","updated_at":"2025-08-04T19:39:14Z","body":"In general we are not doing an auto-orthonormalize in the engine for any stuff that updates often or even every frame/step/update because the performance impact of doing these wasteful orthos is too big.\r\n\r\nThe documention was very clear for years by now that users are expected to occasionally do their own orthonormalize when dealing with transforms and basis changes a lot because float errors can accumulate. It is a very basic knowledge and a basic user responsibility.\r\n\r\nIf people think this should be handled for PathFollow it at least should not be done every single update.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.